    "title": "Local Iowa high school baseball and softball highlights and scores (6-24-26) - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Anthony Mitchell Alexander Huddleston ,\n1 hours ago\nSIOUX CITY, Iowa (KCAU) – Here is a look at some scores of local high school baseball and softball games from June 24th!\nSoftball Woodbury Central 7, Ridge View 0\nWest Monona 9, Westwood 1\nExira-EHK-Audubon 13, Ar-We-Va 3\nBishop Heelan 15, Council Bluffs Lincoln 3 – Game 1\nLawton-Bronson 9, Kingsley-Pierson 6\nGeorge-Little Rock 4, Trinity Christian 2\nHinton 11, Akron-Westfield 1\nAlta-Aurelia 6, Emmetsburg 5\nHarris-Lake Park 9, Hartley-Melvin-Sanborn 1\nNewell-Fonda 13, South Central Calhoun 2\nSoutheast Valley 4, GTRA 3\nRemsen St. Mary’s 13, Sibley-Ocheyedan 4\nSouth O’Brien 2, MMCRU 1\nPocahontas Area 10, West Bend-Mallard 0\nSheldon 10, Boyden-Hull/Rock Valley 8\nWest Lyon 6, MOC-Floyd Valley 2\nBishop Heelan 10, Council Bluffs Lincoln 0 – Game 2\nOABCIG 10, MVAOCOU 2\nBaseball Ar-We-Va 5, Exira-EHK 0\nHarris-Lake Park 11, Hartley-Melvin-Sanborn 1\nGeorge-Little Rock 1, Trinity Christian 0\nHinton 3, Akron-Westfield 1\nWestern Christian 7, Cherokee 2\nGehlen Catholic 2, West Sioux 1\nMMCRU 14, South O’Brien 1\nEmmetsburg 6, Alta-Aurelia 2\nSouth Central Calhoun 8, Newell-Fonda 7\nRemsen St. Mary’s 23, Sibley-Ocheyedan 1\nCopyright 2026 Nexstar Media, Inc. All rights reserved. This material may not be published, broadcast, rewritten, or redistributed. For the latest news, weather, sports, and streaming video, head to KCAU 9 News | Sioux City, IA | News, Weather, and Sports.",
